@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Validasi GPS

actor Mahasiswa
participant "Aplikasi" as App
participant "Sistem" as System
participant "GPS Device" as GPS
participant "Database" as DB

Mahasiswa -> App : Melakukan presensi

App -> GPS : Ambil lokasi pengguna
GPS --> App : Data lokasi

App -> System : Kirim data lokasi

System -> DB : Ambil titik lokasi kampus
DB --> System : Data lokasi kampus

alt Lokasi valid
    System --> App : Presensi diterima
    App --> Mahasiswa : Presensi berhasil
else Lokasi tidak valid
    System --> App : Presensi ditolak
    App --> Mahasiswa : Diluar area presensi
end

@enduml